STRATEGY_VERSION=v1.0.0-classic5pt
MODEL_TYPE=5-Point Multi-Timeframe Confluence Matrix
EVALUATION_CADENCE=250ms with :55s Lock & :58s Flip Watchdog

POINT_ALLOCATION:
- 15m Trend: Bullish (+1.5 CALL) / Bearish (+1.5 PUT)
- 5m Trend: Bullish (+1.0 CALL) / Bearish (+1.0 PUT)
- 1m RSI (14): <= 32 (+1.5 CALL) / >= 68 (+1.5 PUT)
- 1m RSI Momentum: > 50 & 5m Bull (+0.5 CALL) / < 50 & 5m Bear (+0.5 PUT)
- 20-Bar S/R Proximity: (Low - S)/Range < 0.15 (+1.0 CALL) / (R - High)/Range < 0.15 (+1.0 PUT)

TIER_THRESHOLDS:
- STRONG: Score >= 3.5
- BIAS:   Score >= 2.5
- NEUTRAL: Score < 2.5